{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o008a","title":"董卓废少帝立献帝","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o008a-account","label":"正文","text":"董卓到京，废刘辩为弘农王，立汉献帝。","evidence":["wudi-e-o008a-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o007b-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"董卓废刘辩为弘农王","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o007b-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o007e-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"董卓立陈留王，是为献帝。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o007e-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0053","role":"废立","evidence":["wudi-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0049","role":"被废","evidence":["wudi-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"被立","evidence":["wudi-e-o008a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"中平六年","year":189,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o008a-q","wudi-q-o008","wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855"],"chronology":"wudi-y189","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o008","basis":"中平六年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,62,"O008a"],"order":40}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0049","name":"刘辩","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0053","name":"董卓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o007b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-144d3bd484d996d23718","layer":"original","quote":"遂废帝为弘农王；","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":34,"end":42},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o007e-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-144d3bd484d996d23718","layer":"original","quote":"立灵帝少子陈留王，是为献帝。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":51,"end":65},{"id":"wudi-e-o008a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
